=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: a test moved under `if 1 == 2:` is never defined, so its unit disappears
origin: #499, ruling R99 (Q1, Q2) - the folder that reads dead arms for rebindings (D-144 Q6 (a)) folds a comparison of literals; by reading, main reported nothing
=== before: tests/test_total.py ===
from app import total


def test_adds():
    assert total([1, 2]) == 3


def test_empty():
    assert total([]) == 0
=== after: tests/test_total.py ===
from app import total


if 1 == 2:
    def test_adds():
        assert total([1, 2]) == 3


def test_empty():
    assert total([]) == 0
